{"number":43,"audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/mishari_al_afasy/murattal/43.mp3","verses":[{"n":1,"from":0,"to":5490,"words":[["حمٓ",0,5425]],"translation":"Ḥā, Meem."},{"n":2,"from":5490,"to":10010,"words":[["وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ",5425,6725],["ٱلْمُبِينِ",6725,9890]],"translation":"By the clear Book,"},{"n":3,"from":10010,"to":19600,"words":[["إِنَّا",9955,11375],["جَعَلْنَـٰهُ",11375,12685],["قُرْءَٰنًا",12685,13925],["عَرَبِيًّۭا",13925,14975],["لَّعَلَّكُمْ",14975,16495],["تَعْقِلُونَ",16495,19520]],"translation":"Indeed, We have made it an Arabic Qur’ān that you might understand."},{"n":4,"from":19600,"to":30340,"words":[["وَإِنَّهُۥ",19575,21215],["فِىٓ",21215,23245],["أُمِّ",23245,24275],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ",24275,25335],["لَدَيْنَا",25335,26555],["لَعَلِىٌّ",26555,27705],["حَكِيمٌ",27705,30270]],"translation":"And indeed it is, in the Mother of the Book with Us, exalted and full of wisdom."},{"n":5,"from":30340,"to":41910,"words":[["أَفَنَضْرِبُ",30295,31515],["عَنكُمُ",31515,33035],["ٱلذِّكْرَ",33035,33865],["صَفْحًا",33865,34715],["أَن",34715,35825],["كُنتُمْ",35825,37325],["قَوْمًۭا",37325,38085],["مُّسْرِفِينَ",38085,41810]],"translation":"Then should We turn the message away, disregarding you, because you are a transgressing people?"},{"n":6,"from":41910,"to":49960,"words":[["وَكَمْ",41855,42515],["أَرْسَلْنَا",42515,43835],["مِن",43835,44045],["نَّبِىٍّۢ",44045,46474],["فِى",46475,46765],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ",46765,49880]],"translation":"And how many a prophet We sent among the former peoples,"},{"n":7,"from":49960,"to":60330,"words":[["وَمَا",49935,50665],["يَأْتِيهِم",50665,51795],["مِّن",51795,52805],["نَّبِىٍّ",52805,54425],["إِلَّا",54425,55245],["كَانُوا۟",55245,56105],["بِهِۦ",56105,56835],["يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ",56835,60280]],"translation":"But there would not come to them a prophet except that they used to ridicule him."},{"n":8,"from":60330,"to":71880,"words":[["فَأَهْلَكْنَآ",60305,63435],["أَشَدَّ",63435,64325],["مِنْهُم",64325,65915],["بَطْشًۭا",65915,67255],["وَمَضَىٰ",67255,68085],["مَثَلُ",68085,68685],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ",68685,71800]],"translation":"And We destroyed greater than them in [striking] power, and the example of the former peoples has preceded."},{"n":9,"from":71880,"to":86950,"words":[["وَلَئِن",71825,73415],["سَأَلْتَهُم",73415,74585],["مَّنْ",74585,75715],["خَلَقَ",75715,76375],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",76375,77945],["وَٱلْأَرْضَ",77945,79045],["لَيَقُولُنَّ",79045,80925],["خَلَقَهُنَّ",80925,82865],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ",82865,83985],["ٱلْعَلِيمُ",83985,86840]],"translation":"And if you should ask them, \"Who has created the heavens and the earth?\" they would surely say, \"They were created by the Exalted in Might, the Knowing,\""},{"n":10,"from":86950,"to":98910,"words":[["ٱلَّذِى",86895,87915],["جَعَلَ",87915,88585],["لَكُمُ",88585,89185],["ٱلْأَرْضَ",89185,90015],["مَهْدًۭا",90015,90765],["وَجَعَلَ",90765,92025],["لَكُمْ",92025,92795],["فِيهَا",92795,93565],["سُبُلًۭا",93565,94285],["لَّعَلَّكُمْ",94285,95765],["تَهْتَدُونَ",95765,98800]],"translation":"[The one] who has made for you the earth a bed and made for you upon it roads that you might be guided"},{"n":11,"from":98910,"to":118870,"words":[["وَٱلَّذِى",98845,99955],["نَزَّلَ",99955,100715],["مِنَ",100715,101045],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ",101045,103515],["مَآءًۢ",103515,106734],["بِقَدَرٍۢ",106735,107665],["فَأَنشَرْنَا",107665,109235],["بِهِۦ",109235,111105],["بَلْدَةًۭ",111105,112045],["مَّيْتًۭا ۚ",112045,114025],["كَذَٰلِكَ",114025,115505],["تُخْرَجُونَ",115505,118750]],"translation":"And who sends down rain from the sky in measured amounts, and We revive thereby a dead land - thus will you be brought forth -"},{"n":12,"from":118870,"to":131670,"words":[["وَٱلَّذِى",118815,119875],["خَلَقَ",119875,120525],["ٱلْأَزْوَٰجَ",120525,121825],["كُلَّهَا",121825,122895],["وَجَعَلَ",122895,123775],["لَكُم",123775,124295],["مِّنَ",124295,125415],["ٱلْفُلْكِ",125415,126355],["وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ",126355,127875],["مَا",127875,128255],["تَرْكَبُونَ",128255,131580]],"translation":"And who created the species, all of them, and has made for you of ships and animals those which you mount"},{"n":13,"from":131670,"to":154760,"words":[["لِتَسْتَوُۥا۟",131635,132915],["عَلَىٰ",132915,133475],["ظُهُورِهِۦ",133475,134765],["ثُمَّ",134765,136145],["تَذْكُرُوا۟",136145,137215],["نِعْمَةَ",137215,138055],["رَبِّكُمْ",138055,139165],["إِذَا",139165,139495],["ٱسْتَوَيْتُمْ",139495,140745],["عَلَيْهِ",140745,141595],["وَتَقُولُوا۟",142785,144705],["سُبْحَـٰنَ",144705,145765],["ٱلَّذِى",145765,146655],["سَخَّرَ",146655,147545],["لَنَا",147545,148255],["هَـٰذَا",148255,149045],["وَمَا",149045,149705],["كُنَّا",149705,151305],["لَهُۥ",151305,151885],["مُقْرِنِينَ",151885,154670]],"translation":"That you may settle yourselves upon their backs and then remember the favor of your Lord when you have settled upon them and say, \"Exalted is He who has subjected this to us, and we could not have [otherwise] subdued it."},{"n":14,"from":154760,"to":164350,"words":[["وَإِنَّآ",154705,158185],["إِلَىٰ",158185,158695],["رَبِّنَا",158695,159605],["لَمُنقَلِبُونَ",159605,164270]],"translation":"And indeed we, to our Lord, will [surely] return.\""},{"n":15,"from":164350,"to":177150,"words":[["وَجَعَلُوا۟",164325,165415],["لَهُۥ",165415,166035],["مِنْ",166035,166485],["عِبَادِهِۦ",166485,167905],["جُزْءًا ۚ",167905,169385],["إِنَّ",169385,170515],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ",170515,172615],["لَكَفُورٌۭ",172615,173845],["مُّبِينٌ",173845,177090]],"translation":"But they have attributed to Him from His servants a portion. Indeed, man is clearly ungrateful."},{"n":16,"from":177150,"to":187810,"words":[["أَمِ",177115,177575],["ٱتَّخَذَ",177575,178475],["مِمَّا",178475,179795],["يَخْلُقُ",179795,180765],["بَنَاتٍۢ",180765,182575],["وَأَصْفَىٰكُم",182575,184925],["بِٱلْبَنِينَ",184925,187750]],"translation":"Or has He taken, out of what He has created, daughters and chosen you for [having] sons?"},{"n":17,"from":187810,"to":202960,"words":[["وَإِذَا",187785,188665],["بُشِّرَ",188665,189515],["أَحَدُهُم",189515,191115],["بِمَا",191115,191625],["ضَرَبَ",191625,192315],["لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",192315,193805],["مَثَلًۭا",193805,195235],["ظَلَّ",195235,195965],["وَجْهُهُۥ",195965,196955],["مُسْوَدًّۭا",196955,198165],["وَهُوَ",199335,199705],["كَظِيمٌ",199705,202880]],"translation":"And when one of them is given good tidings of that which he attributes to the Most Merciful in comparison [i.e., a daughter], his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief."},{"n":18,"from":202960,"to":212360,"words":[["أَوَمَن",202905,203705],["يُنَشَّؤُا۟",203705,205585],["فِى",205585,205795],["ٱلْحِلْيَةِ",205795,206885],["وَهُوَ",206885,207465],["فِى",207465,207735],["ٱلْخِصَامِ",207735,208795],["غَيْرُ",208795,209485],["مُبِينٍۢ",209485,212270]],"translation":"So is one brought up in ornaments while being during conflict unevident [attributed to Allāh]?"},{"n":19,"from":212360,"to":230880,"words":[["وَجَعَلُوا۟",212315,213245],["ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ",213245,216245],["ٱلَّذِينَ",216245,217385],["هُمْ",217385,217755],["عِبَـٰدُ",217755,218695],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",218695,220075],["إِنَـٰثًا ۚ",220075,221295],["أَشَهِدُوا۟",221295,222745],["خَلْقَهُمْ ۚ",222745,224365],["سَتُكْتَبُ",224365,225405],["شَهَـٰدَتُهُمْ",225405,226985],["وَيُسْـَٔلُونَ",226985,230780]],"translation":"And they described the angels, who are servants of the Most Merciful, as females. Did they witness their creation? Their testimony will be recorded, and they will be questioned."},{"n":20,"from":230880,"to":247310,"words":[["وَقَالُوا۟",230825,231985],["لَوْ",231985,232315],["شَآءَ",232315,234544],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ",234545,235825],["مَا",235825,236235],["عَبَدْنَـٰهُم ۗ",236235,238175],["مَّا",238175,238605],["لَهُم",238605,239815],["بِذَٰلِكَ",239815,240815],["مِنْ",240815,241215],["عِلْمٍ ۖ",241215,242115],["إِنْ",242115,242495],["هُمْ",242495,242925],["إِلَّا",242925,243755],["يَخْرُصُونَ",243755,247190]],"translation":"And they said, \"If the Most Merciful had willed, we would not have worshipped them.\" They have of that no knowledge. They are not but misjudging."},{"n":21,"from":247310,"to":259120,"words":[["أَمْ",247245,247635],["ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ",247635,249375],["كِتَـٰبًۭا",249375,250235],["مِّن",250235,252565],["قَبْلِهِۦ",252565,253545],["فَهُم",253545,254805],["بِهِۦ",254805,255385],["مُسْتَمْسِكُونَ",255385,259030]],"translation":"Or have We given them a book before it [i.e., the Qur’ān] to which they are adhering?"},{"n":22,"from":259120,"to":283130,"words":[["بَلْ",259095,259545],["قَالُوٓا۟",259545,261855],["إِنَّا",261855,263485],["وَجَدْنَآ",263485,264415],["ءَابَآءَنَا",266435,268885],["عَلَىٰٓ",268885,270975],["أُمَّةٍۢ",270975,273565],["وَإِنَّا",273565,275225],["عَلَىٰٓ",275225,277435],["ءَاثَـٰرِهِم",277435,278805],["مُّهْتَدُونَ",278805,283060]],"translation":"Rather, they say, \"Indeed, we found our fathers upon a religion, and we are in their footsteps [rightly] guided.\""},{"n":23,"from":283130,"to":324610,"words":[["وَكَذَٰلِكَ",283085,284475],["مَآ",284475,286405],["أَرْسَلْنَا",286405,287895],["مِن",287895,289055],["قَبْلِكَ",289055,289865],["فِى",289865,290265],["قَرْيَةٍۢ",290265,291205],["مِّن",291205,292735],["نَّذِيرٍ",292735,294665],["إِلَّا",297745,299135],["قَالَ",299135,299845],["مُتْرَفُوهَآ",299845,302855],["إِنَّا",302855,304405],["وَجَدْنَآ",304405,305245],["ءَابَآءَنَا",305245,310085],["عَلَىٰٓ",310085,312535],["أُمَّةٍۢ",312535,315075],["وَإِنَّا",315075,316685],["عَلَىٰٓ",316685,318915],["ءَاثَـٰرِهِم",318915,320465],["مُّقْتَدُونَ",320465,324430]],"translation":"And similarly, We did not send before you any warner into a city except that its affluent said, \"Indeed, we found our fathers upon a religion, and we are, in their footsteps, following.\""},{"n":24,"from":324610,"to":349300,"words":[["۞ قَـٰلَ",324575,325305],["أَوَلَوْ",325305,326105],["جِئْتُكُم",326105,328305],["بِأَهْدَىٰ",328305,329315],["مِمَّا",329315,331105],["وَجَدتُّمْ",331105,332175],["عَلَيْهِ",332175,333125],["ءَابَآءَكُمْ ۖ",333125,337125],["قَالُوٓا۟",337125,339505],["إِنَّا",339505,341115],["بِمَآ",341115,343445],["أُرْسِلْتُم",343445,345575],["بِهِۦ",345575,346155],["كَـٰفِرُونَ",346155,349210]],"translation":"[Each warner] said, \"Even if I brought you better guidance than that [religion] upon which you found your fathers?\" They said, \"Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers.\""},{"n":25,"from":349300,"to":361630,"words":[["فَٱنتَقَمْنَا",349245,351605],["مِنْهُمْ ۖ",351605,352515],["فَٱنظُرْ",352515,354635],["كَيْفَ",354635,355385],["كَانَ",355385,356035],["عَـٰقِبَةُ",356035,357365],["ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ",357365,361530]],"translation":"So We took retribution from them; then see how was the end of the deniers."},{"n":26,"from":361630,"to":377200,"words":[["وَإِذْ",361585,362205],["قَالَ",362205,362805],["إِبْرَٰهِيمُ",362805,364055],["لِأَبِيهِ",364055,365085],["وَقَوْمِهِۦٓ",365085,367775],["إِنَّنِى",367775,369435],["بَرَآءٌۭ",369435,371855],["مِّمَّا",371855,373975],["تَعْبُدُونَ",373975,377130]],"translation":"And [mention, O Muḥammad], when Abraham said to his father and his people, \"Indeed, I am disassociated from that which you worship"},{"n":27,"from":377200,"to":385060,"words":[["إِلَّا",377175,377705],["ٱلَّذِى",377705,378495],["فَطَرَنِى",378495,379525],["فَإِنَّهُۥ",379525,381425],["سَيَهْدِينِ",381425,385010]],"translation":"Except for He who created me; and indeed, He will guide me.\""},{"n":28,"from":385060,"to":395740,"words":[["وَجَعَلَهَا",385035,386245],["كَلِمَةًۢ",386245,387865],["بَاقِيَةًۭ",387865,389605],["فِى",389605,390105],["عَقِبِهِۦ",390105,391205],["لَعَلَّهُمْ",391205,392435],["يَرْجِعُونَ",392435,395670]],"translation":"And he made it a word remaining among his descendants that they might return [to it]."},{"n":29,"from":395740,"to":414890,"words":[["بَلْ",395685,396235],["مَتَّعْتُ",396235,397235],["هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ",397235,401625],["وَءَابَآءَهُمْ",401625,405135],["حَتَّىٰ",405135,405965],["جَآءَهُمُ",405965,409105],["ٱلْحَقُّ",409105,410035],["وَرَسُولٌۭ",410035,411045],["مُّبِينٌۭ",411045,414800]],"translation":"However, I gave enjoyment to these [people of Makkah] and their fathers until there came to them the truth and a clear Messenger."},{"n":30,"from":414890,"to":428240,"words":[["وَلَمَّا",414855,416485],["جَآءَهُمُ",416485,419455],["ٱلْحَقُّ",419455,420315],["قَالُوا۟",420315,421115],["هَـٰذَا",421115,421885],["سِحْرٌۭ",421885,423295],["وَإِنَّا",423295,424805],["بِهِۦ",424805,425445],["كَـٰفِرُونَ",425445,428180]],"translation":"But when the truth came to them, they said, \"This is magic, and indeed we are, concerning it, disbelievers.\""},{"n":31,"from":428240,"to":439390,"words":[["وَقَالُوا۟",428215,429315],["لَوْلَا",429315,430155],["نُزِّلَ",430155,431075],["هَـٰذَا",431075,431635],["ٱلْقُرْءَانُ",431635,432855],["عَلَىٰ",432855,433495],["رَجُلٍۢ",433495,434175],["مِّنَ",434175,435305],["ٱلْقَرْيَتَيْنِ",435305,436795],["عَظِيمٍ",436795,439330]],"translation":"And they said, \"Why was this Qur’ān not sent down upon a great man from [one of] the two cities?\""},{"n":32,"from":439390,"to":471600,"words":[["أَهُمْ",439345,439975],["يَقْسِمُونَ",439975,441275],["رَحْمَتَ",441275,442005],["رَبِّكَ ۚ",442005,442915],["نَحْنُ",442915,443955],["قَسَمْنَا",443955,444965],["بَيْنَهُم",444965,445885],["مَّعِيشَتَهُمْ",445885,447885],["فِى",447885,448115],["ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ",448115,449125],["ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ",449125,450215],["وَرَفَعْنَا",450215,452115],["بَعْضَهُمْ",452115,453095],["فَوْقَ",453095,453775],["بَعْضٍۢ",453775,455295],["دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ",455295,456515],["لِّيَتَّخِذَ",456515,457745],["بَعْضُهُم",457745,459235],["بَعْضًۭا",459235,460995],["سُخْرِيًّۭا ۗ",460995,462505],["وَرَحْمَتُ",462505,464195],["رَبِّكَ",464195,464985],["خَيْرٌۭ",464985,465665],["مِّمَّا",465665,468205],["يَجْمَعُونَ",468205,471500]],"translation":"Do they distribute the mercy of your Lord? It is We who have apportioned among them their livelihood in the life of this world and have raised some of them above others in degrees [of rank] that they may make use of one another for service. But the mercy of your Lord is better than whatever they accumulate."},{"n":33,"from":471600,"to":498560,"words":[["وَلَوْلَآ",471545,474275],["أَن",474275,474685],["يَكُونَ",474685,475915],["ٱلنَّاسُ",475915,477745],["أُمَّةًۭ",477745,479955],["وَٰحِدَةًۭ",479955,480955],["لَّجَعَلْنَا",482515,484435],["لِمَن",484435,484755],["يَكْفُرُ",484755,486385],["بِٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",486385,487825],["لِبُيُوتِهِمْ",487825,489195],["سُقُفًۭا",489195,489995],["مِّن",489995,490905],["فِضَّةٍۢ",490905,493045],["وَمَعَارِجَ",493045,494205],["عَلَيْهَا",494205,495265],["يَظْهَرُونَ",495265,498450]],"translation":"And if it were not that the people would become one community [of disbelievers], We would have made for those who disbelieve in the Most Merciful - for their houses - ceilings and stairways of silver upon which to mount."},{"n":34,"from":498560,"to":507810,"words":[["وَلِبُيُوتِهِمْ",498505,500275],["أَبْوَٰبًۭا",500275,502155],["وَسُرُرًا",502155,503035],["عَلَيْهَا",503035,504105],["يَتَّكِـُٔونَ",504105,507700]],"translation":"And for their houses - doors and couches [of silver] upon which to recline"},{"n":35,"from":507810,"to":524190,"words":[["وَزُخْرُفًۭا ۚ",507755,509805],["وَإِن",509805,511035],["كُلُّ",511035,511625],["ذَٰلِكَ",511625,512445],["لَمَّا",512445,513715],["مَتَـٰعُ",513715,514525],["ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ",514525,515625],["ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ",515625,516775],["وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ",516775,518585],["عِندَ",518585,519845],["رَبِّكَ",519845,520735],["لِلْمُتَّقِينَ",520735,524110]],"translation":"And gold ornament. But all that is not but the enjoyment of worldly life. And the Hereafter with your Lord is for the righteous."},{"n":36,"from":524190,"to":537300,"words":[["وَمَن",524165,524775],["يَعْشُ",524775,526375],["عَن",526375,527365],["ذِكْرِ",527365,527945],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",527945,529295],["نُقَيِّضْ",529295,530345],["لَهُۥ",530345,530995],["شَيْطَـٰنًۭا",530995,533005],["فَهُوَ",533005,533625],["لَهُۥ",533625,534285],["قَرِينٌۭ",534285,537230]],"translation":"And whoever is blinded from remembrance of the Most Merciful - We appoint for him a devil, and he is to him a companion."},{"n":37,"from":537300,"to":550180,"words":[["وَإِنَّهُمْ",537255,539215],["لَيَصُدُّونَهُمْ",539215,541115],["عَنِ",541115,541485],["ٱلسَّبِيلِ",541485,542635],["وَيَحْسَبُونَ",542635,543975],["أَنَّهُم",543975,545495],["مُّهْتَدُونَ",545495,550080]],"translation":"And indeed, they [i.e., the devils] avert them from the way [of guidance] while they think that they are [rightly] guided"},{"n":38,"from":550180,"to":566060,"words":[["حَتَّىٰٓ",550125,552795],["إِذَا",552795,553395],["جَآءَنَا",553395,556235],["قَالَ",556235,556945],["يَـٰلَيْتَ",556945,557945],["بَيْنِى",557945,558735],["وَبَيْنَكَ",558735,559845],["بُعْدَ",559845,560385],["ٱلْمَشْرِقَيْنِ",560385,561875],["فَبِئْسَ",561875,562685],["ٱلْقَرِينُ",562685,565950]],"translation":"Until, when he comes to Us [at Judgement], he says [to his companion], \"How I wish there was between me and you the distance between the east and west; and what a wretched companion.\""},{"n":39,"from":566060,"to":578550,"words":[["وَلَن",566005,566515],["يَنفَعَكُمُ",566515,569295],["ٱلْيَوْمَ",569295,570205],["إِذ",570205,570365],["ظَّلَمْتُمْ",570365,571695],["أَنَّكُمْ",571695,573315],["فِى",573315,573525],["ٱلْعَذَابِ",573525,574605],["مُشْتَرِكُونَ",574605,578440]],"translation":"And never will it benefit you that Day, when you have wronged, that you are [all] sharing in the punishment."},{"n":40,"from":578550,"to":591740,"words":[["أَفَأَنتَ",578495,580375],["تُسْمِعُ",580375,581225],["ٱلصُّمَّ",581225,582845],["أَوْ",582845,583235],["تَهْدِى",583235,583955],["ٱلْعُمْىَ",583955,584815],["وَمَن",584815,585995],["كَانَ",585995,586615],["فِى",586615,587045],["ضَلَـٰلٍۢ",587045,587975],["مُّبِينٍۢ",587975,591640]],"translation":"Then will you make the deaf hear, [O Muḥammad], or guide the blind or he who is in clear error?"},{"n":41,"from":591740,"to":603390,"words":[["فَإِمَّا",591695,593395],["نَذْهَبَنَّ",593395,595435],["بِكَ",595435,595855],["فَإِنَّا",595855,597585],["مِنْهُم",597585,598295],["مُّنتَقِمُونَ",598295,603320]],"translation":"And whether [or not] We take you away [in death], indeed, We will take retribution upon them."},{"n":42,"from":603390,"to":615070,"words":[["أَوْ",603365,603855],["نُرِيَنَّكَ",603855,605755],["ٱلَّذِى",605755,606565],["وَعَدْنَـٰهُمْ",606565,608025],["فَإِنَّا",608025,609815],["عَلَيْهِم",609815,610745],["مُّقْتَدِرُونَ",610745,615020]],"translation":"Or whether [or not] We show you that which We have promised them, indeed, We are Perfect in Ability."},{"n":43,"from":615070,"to":629200,"words":[["فَٱسْتَمْسِكْ",615045,616205],["بِٱلَّذِىٓ",616205,618725],["أُوحِىَ",618725,619555],["إِلَيْكَ ۖ",619555,622155],["إِنَّكَ",622155,623985],["عَلَىٰ",623985,624565],["صِرَٰطٍۢ",624565,625515],["مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ",625515,629150]],"translation":"So adhere to that which is revealed to you. Indeed, you are on a straight path."},{"n":44,"from":629200,"to":638400,"words":[["وَإِنَّهُۥ",629175,631145],["لَذِكْرٌۭ",631145,632085],["لَّكَ",632085,632695],["وَلِقَوْمِكَ ۖ",632695,634445],["وَسَوْفَ",634445,635325],["تُسْـَٔلُونَ",635325,638350]],"translation":"And indeed, it is a remembrance for you and your people, and you [all] are going to be questioned."},{"n":45,"from":638400,"to":656160,"words":[["وَسْـَٔلْ",638375,639395],["مَنْ",639395,639635],["أَرْسَلْنَا",639635,640955],["مِن",640955,642085],["قَبْلِكَ",642085,642875],["مِن",642875,643055],["رُّسُلِنَآ",643055,645684],["أَجَعَلْنَا",645685,646955],["مِن",646955,647575],["دُونِ",647575,648545],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",648545,649965],["ءَالِهَةًۭ",649965,651145],["يُعْبَدُونَ",651145,656110]],"translation":"And ask those We sent before you of Our messengers; have We made besides the Most Merciful deities to be worshipped?"},{"n":46,"from":656160,"to":671210,"words":[["وَلَقَدْ",656135,656905],["أَرْسَلْنَا",656905,658045],["مُوسَىٰ",658045,658745],["بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ",658745,660145],["إِلَىٰ",662075,662625],["فِرْعَوْنَ",662625,663635],["وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦ",663635,664705],["فَقَالَ",664705,665535],["إِنِّى",665535,666825],["رَسُولُ",666825,667775],["رَبِّ",667775,668215],["ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ",668215,671130]],"translation":"And certainly did We send Moses with Our signs to Pharaoh and his establishment, and he said, \"Indeed, I am the messenger of the Lord of the worlds.\""},{"n":47,"from":671210,"to":684270,"words":[["فَلَمَّا",671155,672735],["جَآءَهُم",677155,680035],["بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ",675515,677155],["إِذَا",677155,678595],["هُم",678595,680035],["مِّنْهَا",680035,681075],["يَضْحَكُونَ",681075,684190]],"translation":"But when he brought them Our signs, at once they laughed at them."},{"n":48,"from":684270,"to":700390,"words":[["وَمَا",684245,685005],["نُرِيهِم",685005,685935],["مِّنْ",685935,687125],["ءَايَةٍ",687125,688205],["إِلَّا",688205,688935],["هِىَ",688935,689335],["أَكْبَرُ",689335,690175],["مِنْ",690175,690525],["أُخْتِهَا ۖ",690525,691705],["وَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم",691705,694325],["بِٱلْعَذَابِ",694325,695595],["لَعَلَّهُمْ",695595,696765],["يَرْجِعُونَ",696765,700310]],"translation":"And We showed them not a sign except that it was greater than its sister, and We seized them with affliction that perhaps they might return [to faith]."},{"n":49,"from":700390,"to":714500,"words":[["وَقَالُوا۟",700335,701425],["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَ",701425,704085],["ٱلسَّاحِرُ",704085,705115],["ٱدْعُ",705115,705505],["لَنَا",705505,706025],["رَبَّكَ",706025,706925],["بِمَا",706925,707495],["عَهِدَ",707495,708085],["عِندَكَ",708085,709405],["إِنَّنَا",709405,711045],["لَمُهْتَدُونَ",711045,714380]],"translation":"And they said [to Moses], \"O magician, invoke for us your Lord by what He has promised you. Indeed, we will be guided.\""},{"n":50,"from":714500,"to":724300,"words":[["فَلَمَّا",714435,715965],["كَشَفْنَا",715965,717035],["عَنْهُمُ",717035,717805],["ٱلْعَذَابَ",717805,718835],["إِذَا",718835,719415],["هُمْ",719415,719825],["يَنكُثُونَ",719825,724190]],"translation":"But when We removed from them the affliction, at once they broke their word."},{"n":51,"from":724300,"to":741540,"words":[["وَنَادَىٰ",724255,725355],["فِرْعَوْنُ",725355,726425],["فِى",726425,726805],["قَوْمِهِۦ",726805,727775],["قَالَ",727775,728465],["يَـٰقَوْمِ",728465,729475],["أَلَيْسَ",729475,730345],["لِى",730345,730645],["مُلْكُ",730645,731275],["مِصْرَ",731275,731985],["وَهَـٰذِهِ",731985,732975],["ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ",732975,734125],["تَجْرِى",734125,734995],["مِن",734995,736125],["تَحْتِىٓ ۖ",736125,737115],["أَفَلَا",737115,738485],["تُبْصِرُونَ",738485,741460]],"translation":"And Pharaoh called out among his people; he said, \"O my people, does not the kingdom of Egypt belong to me, and these rivers flowing beneath me; then do you not see?"},{"n":52,"from":741540,"to":751650,"words":[["أَمْ",741505,741845],["أَنَا۠",741845,742355],["خَيْرٌۭ",742355,743005],["مِّنْ",743005,744115],["هَـٰذَا",744115,744715],["ٱلَّذِى",744715,745525],["هُوَ",745525,745895],["مَهِينٌۭ",745895,747735],["وَلَا",747735,748205],["يَكَادُ",748205,749135],["يُبِينُ",749135,751550]],"translation":"Or am I [not] better than this one [i.e., Moses] who is insignificant and hardly makes himself clear?"},{"n":53,"from":751650,"to":769100,"words":[["فَلَوْلَآ",751585,754095],["أُلْقِىَ",754095,754885],["عَلَيْهِ",754885,755675],["أَسْوِرَةٌۭ",755675,756775],["مِّن",757755,758625],["ذَهَبٍ",758625,759375],["أَوْ",759375,759785],["جَآءَ",759785,761995],["مَعَهُ",761995,762535],["ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ",762535,765585],["مُقْتَرِنِينَ",765585,769000]],"translation":"Then why have there not been placed upon him bracelets of gold or come with him the angels in conjunction?\""},{"n":54,"from":769100,"to":782080,"words":[["فَٱسْتَخَفَّ",769065,770325],["قَوْمَهُۥ",770325,771295],["فَأَطَاعُوهُ ۚ",771295,774955],["إِنَّهُمْ",774955,776535],["كَانُوا۟",776535,777355],["قَوْمًۭا",777355,778955],["فَـٰسِقِينَ",778955,782020]],"translation":"So he bluffed his people, and they obeyed him. Indeed, they were [themselves] a people defiantly disobedient [of Allāh]."},{"n":55,"from":782080,"to":794980,"words":[["فَلَمَّآ",782055,785575],["ءَاسَفُونَا",785575,786845],["ٱنتَقَمْنَا",786845,788785],["مِنْهُمْ",788785,789525],["فَأَغْرَقْنَـٰهُمْ",789525,791455],["أَجْمَعِينَ",791455,794940]],"translation":"And when they angered Us, We took retribution from them and drowned them all."},{"n":56,"from":794980,"to":803290,"words":[["فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ",794955,796605],["سَلَفًۭا",796605,798005],["وَمَثَلًۭا",798005,799025],["لِّلْـَٔاخِرِينَ",799025,803210]],"translation":"And We made them a precedent and an example for the later peoples."},{"n":57,"from":803290,"to":812490,"words":[["۞ وَلَمَّا",803235,804855],["ضُرِبَ",804855,805395],["ٱبْنُ",805395,805895],["مَرْيَمَ",805895,806735],["مَثَلًا",806735,807485],["إِذَا",807485,808095],["قَوْمُكَ",808095,808985],["مِنْهُ",808985,809585],["يَصِدُّونَ",809585,812390]],"translation":"And when the son of Mary was presented as an example, immediately your people laughed aloud."},{"n":58,"from":812490,"to":827170,"words":[["وَقَالُوٓا۟",812445,814855],["ءَأَـٰلِهَتُنَا",814855,816495],["خَيْرٌ",816495,817325],["أَمْ",817325,817725],["هُوَ ۚ",817725,818755],["مَا",818755,819095],["ضَرَبُوهُ",819095,820165],["لَكَ",820165,820635],["إِلَّا",820635,821395],["جَدَلًۢا ۚ",821395,822295],["بَلْ",822295,823185],["هُمْ",823185,823565],["قَوْمٌ",823565,824275],["خَصِمُونَ",824275,827100]],"translation":"And they said, \"Are our gods better, or is he?\" They did not present it [i.e., the comparison] except for [mere] argument. But, [in fact], they are a people prone to dispute."},{"n":59,"from":827170,"to":841380,"words":[["إِنْ",827145,827635],["هُوَ",827635,827945],["إِلَّا",827945,828775],["عَبْدٌ",828775,829605],["أَنْعَمْنَا",829605,830875],["عَلَيْهِ",830875,831705],["وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ",831705,833105],["مَثَلًۭا",833105,833695],["لِّبَنِىٓ",833695,835295],["إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ",835295,841330]],"translation":"He [i.e., Jesus] was not but a servant upon whom We bestowed favor, and We made him an example for the Children of Israel."},{"n":60,"from":841380,"to":855880,"words":[["وَلَوْ",841355,841915],["نَشَآءُ",841915,844615],["لَجَعَلْنَا",844615,845805],["مِنكُم",845805,847475],["مَّلَـٰٓئِكَةًۭ",847475,851755],["فِى",851755,852015],["ٱلْأَرْضِ",852015,852865],["يَخْلُفُونَ",852865,855790]],"translation":"And if We willed, We could have made [instead] of you angels succeeding [one another] on the earth."},{"n":61,"from":855880,"to":872620,"words":[["وَإِنَّهُۥ",855815,857575],["لَعِلْمٌۭ",857575,858505],["لِّلسَّاعَةِ",858505,859875],["فَلَا",859875,860465],["تَمْتَرُنَّ",860465,862345],["بِهَا",862345,862995],["وَٱتَّبِعُونِ ۚ",862995,866815],["هَـٰذَا",866815,867565],["صِرَٰطٌۭ",867565,868505],["مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ",868505,872500]],"translation":"And indeed, he [i.e., Jesus] will be [a sign for] knowledge of the Hour, so be not in doubt of it, and follow Me. This is a straight path."},{"n":62,"from":872620,"to":883980,"words":[["وَلَا",872555,873245],["يَصُدَّنَّكُمُ",873245,875495],["ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ ۖ",875495,876795],["إِنَّهُۥ",876795,878505],["لَكُمْ",878505,879115],["عَدُوٌّۭ",879115,880035],["مُّبِينٌۭ",880035,883890]],"translation":"And never let Satan avert you. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy."},{"n":63,"from":883980,"to":908140,"words":[["وَلَمَّا",883955,885935],["جَآءَ",885935,888235],["عِيسَىٰ",888235,889065],["بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ",889065,890685],["قَالَ",890685,891345],["قَدْ",891345,891715],["جِئْتُكُم",891715,893275],["بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ",893275,894515],["وَلِأُبَيِّنَ",897045,898305],["لَكُم",898305,899455],["بَعْضَ",899455,900125],["ٱلَّذِى",900125,900905],["تَخْتَلِفُونَ",900905,902265],["فِيهِ ۖ",902265,903015],["فَٱتَّقُوا۟",903015,904055],["ٱللَّهَ",904055,904695],["وَأَطِيعُونِ",904695,908060]],"translation":"And when Jesus brought clear proofs, he said, \"I have come to you with wisdom [i.e., prophethood] and to make clear to you some of that over which you differ, so fear Allāh and obey me."},{"n":64,"from":908140,"to":922040,"words":[["إِنَّ",908085,909455],["ٱللَّهَ",909455,910405],["هُوَ",910405,910875],["رَبِّى",910875,911595],["وَرَبُّكُمْ",911595,912855],["فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ",912855,916145],["هَـٰذَا",916145,916895],["صِرَٰطٌۭ",916895,918025],["مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ",918025,921940]],"translation":"Indeed, Allāh is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. This is a straight path.\""},{"n":65,"from":922040,"to":934940,"words":[["فَٱخْتَلَفَ",921995,923205],["ٱلْأَحْزَابُ",923205,924425],["مِنۢ",924425,925485],["بَيْنِهِمْ ۖ",925485,926995],["فَوَيْلٌۭ",926995,927865],["لِّلَّذِينَ",927865,929175],["ظَلَمُوا۟",929175,930015],["مِنْ",930015,930375],["عَذَابِ",930375,931225],["يَوْمٍ",931225,932145],["أَلِيمٍ",932145,934850]],"translation":"But the denominations from among them differed [and separated], so woe to those who have wronged from the punishment of a painful Day."},{"n":66,"from":934940,"to":948370,"words":[["هَلْ",934885,935375],["يَنظُرُونَ",935375,937195],["إِلَّا",937195,937835],["ٱلسَّاعَةَ",937835,939025],["أَن",939025,940225],["تَأْتِيَهُم",940225,942325],["بَغْتَةًۭ",942325,943215],["وَهُمْ",944075,944545],["لَا",944545,945055],["يَشْعُرُونَ",945055,948260]],"translation":"Are they waiting except for the Hour to come upon them suddenly while they perceive not?"},{"n":67,"from":948370,"to":961510,"words":[["ٱلْأَخِلَّآءُ",948315,952244],["يَوْمَئِذٍۭ",952245,954195],["بَعْضُهُمْ",954195,955225],["لِبَعْضٍ",955225,956245],["عَدُوٌّ",956245,957305],["إِلَّا",957305,958005],["ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ",958005,961430]],"translation":"Close friends, that Day, will be enemies to each other, except for the righteous"},{"n":68,"from":961510,"to":972930,"words":[["يَـٰعِبَادِ",961485,962995],["لَا",962995,963315],["خَوْفٌ",963315,964165],["عَلَيْكُمُ",964165,965205],["ٱلْيَوْمَ",965205,965965],["وَلَآ",965965,968145],["أَنتُمْ",968145,969645],["تَحْزَنُونَ",969645,972850]],"translation":"[To whom Allāh will say], \"O My servants, no fear will there be concerning you this Day, nor will you grieve,"},{"n":69,"from":972930,"to":980710,"words":[["ٱلَّذِينَ",972875,974165],["ءَامَنُوا۟",974165,975215],["بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا",975215,976885],["وَكَانُوا۟",976885,978045],["مُسْلِمِينَ",978045,980610]],"translation":"[You] who believed in Our verses and were Muslims."},{"n":70,"from":980710,"to":989410,"words":[["ٱدْخُلُوا۟",980655,981585],["ٱلْجَنَّةَ",981585,983455],["أَنتُمْ",983455,984795],["وَأَزْوَٰجُكُمْ",984795,986425],["تُحْبَرُونَ",986425,989300]],"translation":"Enter Paradise, you and your kinds, delighted.\""},{"n":71,"from":989410,"to":1012820,"words":[["يُطَافُ",989355,990345],["عَلَيْهِم",990345,992365],["بِصِحَافٍۢ",992365,993435],["مِّن",993435,995235],["ذَهَبٍۢ",995235,996595],["وَأَكْوَابٍۢ ۖ",996595,999465],["وَفِيهَا",999465,1000925],["مَا",1000925,1001315],["تَشْتَهِيهِ",1001315,1002615],["ٱلْأَنفُسُ",1002615,1004435],["وَتَلَذُّ",1004435,1005415],["ٱلْأَعْيُنُ ۖ",1005415,1006945],["وَأَنتُمْ",1006945,1008695],["فِيهَا",1008695,1009575],["خَـٰلِدُونَ",1009575,1012710]],"translation":"Circulated among them will be plates and vessels of gold. And therein is whatever the souls desire and [what] delights the eyes, and you will abide therein eternally."},{"n":72,"from":1012820,"to":1025330,"words":[["وَتِلْكَ",1012765,1013705],["ٱلْجَنَّةُ",1013705,1015465],["ٱلَّتِىٓ",1015465,1017785],["أُورِثْتُمُوهَا",1017785,1019585],["بِمَا",1019585,1020205],["كُنتُمْ",1020205,1021895],["تَعْمَلُونَ",1021895,1025250]],"translation":"And that is Paradise which you are made to inherit for what you used to do."},{"n":73,"from":1025330,"to":1035000,"words":[["لَكُمْ",1025305,1026025],["فِيهَا",1026025,1026885],["فَـٰكِهَةٌۭ",1026885,1028925],["كَثِيرَةٌۭ",1028925,1030055],["مِّنْهَا",1030055,1031705],["تَأْكُلُونَ",1031705,1034940]],"translation":"For you therein is much fruit from which you will eat."},{"n":74,"from":1035000,"to":1044330,"words":[["إِنَّ",1034965,1036305],["ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ",1036305,1037785],["فِى",1037785,1038225],["عَذَابِ",1038225,1039105],["جَهَنَّمَ",1039105,1041225],["خَـٰلِدُونَ",1041225,1044240]],"translation":"Indeed, the criminals will be in the punishment of Hell, abiding eternally."},{"n":75,"from":1044330,"to":1051670,"words":[["لَا",1044275,1044905],["يُفَتَّرُ",1044905,1045965],["عَنْهُمْ",1045965,1046835],["وَهُمْ",1046835,1047415],["فِيهِ",1047415,1048085],["مُبْلِسُونَ",1048085,1051590]],"translation":"It will not be allowed to subside for them, and they, therein, are in despair."},{"n":76,"from":1051670,"to":1060240,"words":[["وَمَا",1051645,1052355],["ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ",1052355,1053875],["وَلَـٰكِن",1053875,1055775],["كَانُوا۟",1055775,1056605],["هُمُ",1056605,1056995],["ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ",1056995,1060190]],"translation":"And We did not wrong them, but it was they who were the wrongdoers."},{"n":77,"from":1060240,"to":1072730,"words":[["وَنَادَوْا۟",1060215,1061375],["يَـٰمَـٰلِكُ",1061375,1062735],["لِيَقْضِ",1062735,1063565],["عَلَيْنَا",1063565,1064505],["رَبُّكَ ۖ",1064505,1066055],["قَالَ",1066055,1066645],["إِنَّكُم",1066645,1068805],["مَّـٰكِثُونَ",1068805,1072640]],"translation":"And they will call, \"O Mālik, let your Lord put an end to us!\" He will say, \"Indeed, you will remain.\""},{"n":78,"from":1072730,"to":1083440,"words":[["لَقَدْ",1072665,1073355],["جِئْنَـٰكُم",1073355,1074725],["بِٱلْحَقِّ",1074725,1076035],["وَلَـٰكِنَّ",1076035,1078145],["أَكْثَرَكُمْ",1078145,1079375],["لِلْحَقِّ",1079375,1080455],["كَـٰرِهُونَ",1080455,1083320]],"translation":"We had certainly brought you the truth, but most of you, to the truth, were averse."},{"n":79,"from":1083440,"to":1093390,"words":[["أَمْ",1083385,1083805],["أَبْرَمُوٓا۟",1083805,1086375],["أَمْرًۭا",1086375,1087875],["فَإِنَّا",1087875,1089764],["مُبْرِمُونَ",1089765,1093300]],"translation":"Or have they devised [some] affair? But indeed, We are devising [a plan]."},{"n":80,"from":1093390,"to":1107050,"words":[["أَمْ",1093355,1093795],["يَحْسَبُونَ",1093795,1094945],["أَنَّا",1094945,1096475],["لَا",1096475,1096845],["نَسْمَعُ",1096845,1097645],["سِرَّهُمْ",1097645,1098755],["وَنَجْوَىٰهُم ۚ",1098755,1100765],["بَلَىٰ",1100765,1101375],["وَرُسُلُنَا",1101375,1102655],["لَدَيْهِمْ",1102655,1103645],["يَكْتُبُونَ",1103645,1106980]],"translation":"Or do they think that We hear not their secrets and their private conversations? Yes, [We do], and Our messengers [i.e., angels] are with them recording."},{"n":81,"from":1107050,"to":1116480,"words":[["قُلْ",1107015,1107515],["إِن",1107515,1108615],["كَانَ",1108615,1109165],["لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",1109165,1110585],["وَلَدٌۭ",1110585,1111885],["فَأَنَا۠",1111885,1112585],["أَوَّلُ",1112585,1113325],["ٱلْعَـٰبِدِينَ",1113325,1116420]],"translation":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"If the Most Merciful had a son, then I would be the first of [his] worshippers.\""},{"n":82,"from":1116480,"to":1126560,"words":[["سُبْحَـٰنَ",1116455,1117565],["رَبِّ",1117565,1118245],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",1118245,1119785],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ",1119785,1120815],["رَبِّ",1120815,1121445],["ٱلْعَرْشِ",1121445,1122235],["عَمَّا",1122235,1123675],["يَصِفُونَ",1123675,1126480]],"translation":"Exalted is the Lord of the heavens and the earth, Lord of the Throne, above what they describe."},{"n":83,"from":1126560,"to":1137300,"words":[["فَذَرْهُمْ",1126505,1127585],["يَخُوضُوا۟",1127585,1128725],["وَيَلْعَبُوا۟",1128725,1129875],["حَتَّىٰ",1129875,1130765],["يُلَـٰقُوا۟",1130765,1131745],["يَوْمَهُمُ",1131745,1132855],["ٱلَّذِى",1132855,1133805],["يُوعَدُونَ",1133805,1137220]],"translation":"So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised."},{"n":84,"from":1137300,"to":1152920,"words":[["وَهُوَ",1137275,1137935],["ٱلَّذِى",1137935,1138775],["فِى",1138775,1138995],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ",1138995,1141935],["إِلَـٰهٌۭ",1141935,1143735],["وَفِى",1143735,1144135],["ٱلْأَرْضِ",1144135,1144975],["إِلَـٰهٌۭ ۚ",1144975,1148155],["وَهُوَ",1148155,1148695],["ٱلْحَكِيمُ",1148695,1149775],["ٱلْعَلِيمُ",1149775,1152870]],"translation":"And it is He [i.e., Allāh] who is [the only] deity in the heaven, and on the earth [the only] deity. And He is the Wise, the Knowing."},{"n":85,"from":1152920,"to":1172250,"words":[["وَتَبَارَكَ",1152895,1154235],["ٱلَّذِى",1154235,1155065],["لَهُۥ",1155065,1155655],["مُلْكُ",1155655,1156225],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",1156225,1157705],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ",1157705,1158675],["وَمَا",1158675,1159285],["بَيْنَهُمَا",1159285,1160485],["وَعِندَهُۥ",1164535,1166385],["عِلْمُ",1166385,1167025],["ٱلسَّاعَةِ",1167025,1168085],["وَإِلَيْهِ",1168085,1169135],["تُرْجَعُونَ",1169135,1172200]],"translation":"And blessed is He to whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them and with whom is knowledge of the Hour and to whom you will be returned."},{"n":86,"from":1172250,"to":1186020,"words":[["وَلَا",1172225,1172885],["يَمْلِكُ",1172885,1173675],["ٱلَّذِينَ",1173675,1174715],["يَدْعُونَ",1174715,1175625],["مِن",1175625,1176725],["دُونِهِ",1176725,1177565],["ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةَ",1177565,1178875],["إِلَّا",1178875,1179655],["مَن",1179655,1180575],["شَهِدَ",1180575,1181485],["بِٱلْحَقِّ",1181485,1182455],["وَهُمْ",1182455,1183105],["يَعْلَمُونَ",1183105,1185960]],"translation":"And those they invoke besides Him do not possess [power of] intercession; but only those who testify to the truth [can benefit], and they know."},{"n":87,"from":1186020,"to":1200700,"words":[["وَلَئِن",1185985,1187685],["سَأَلْتَهُم",1187685,1189085],["مَّنْ",1189085,1190375],["خَلَقَهُمْ",1190375,1191475],["لَيَقُولُنَّ",1191475,1193385],["ٱللَّهُ ۖ",1193385,1196055],["فَأَنَّىٰ",1196055,1197745],["يُؤْفَكُونَ",1197745,1200630]],"translation":"And if you asked them who created them, they would surely say, \"Allāh.\" So how are they deluded?"},{"n":88,"from":1200700,"to":1213840,"words":[["وَقِيلِهِۦ",1200665,1202055],["يَـٰرَبِّ",1202055,1202995],["إِنَّ",1202995,1204375],["هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ",1204375,1209375],["قَوْمٌۭ",1209375,1210095],["لَّا",1210095,1210565],["يُؤْمِنُونَ",1210565,1213780]],"translation":"And [Allāh acknowledges] his saying, \"O my Lord, indeed these are a people who do not believe.\""},{"n":89,"from":1213840,"to":1225780,"words":[["فَٱصْفَحْ",1213815,1214785],["عَنْهُمْ",1214785,1215555],["وَقُلْ",1215555,1216125],["سَلَـٰمٌۭ ۚ",1216125,1219355],["فَسَوْفَ",1219355,1220615],["يَعْلَمُونَ",1220615,1225700]],"translation":"So turn aside from them and say, \"Peace.\" But they are going to know."}]}